[Options]

[A.]
<h2>The Few, The Fallen</h2>
<i>"When down to the last strand of hope and life, then you shall see the true powers of pride and desperation."<br>
-- General Olamond, War Tactician</i>

<p> The Valdras Empire is down to its last island - the Fortress of Zaladri. They have put all their effort and remaining troops into defending the Fortress. Crush them!

$Button=Review Knowledge,ShowTechnology,55
$Button=Play Mission,DoNothing,0

[BadTeamDead]
<h2>Success!</h2>
<p> You have achieved your final and greatest goal - the conquest of the Valdras Empire! You shall be heralded as a hero for eternity. Your people throw you a celebration, but during the festivities you can't shake the feeling that you haven't seen the last of the Valdras army.

<$Config,Done{mission.fileName}=1>
$Button=Leave Missions,MissionAbort,1


[Failed]
<h2>Death...</h2>
<p>
You make your greatest mistake at a time that should be your greatest moment. Never again shall you underestimate the pride and hope of the fallen.

$Button=Continue,Tell,TryAgain

[END]